[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_01_0010","text":"好，那就开始吧。\n“ALSTROEMERIA寻蛋大赛”开始！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_01_0020","text":"…………\n啊！找到了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_01_0030","text":"……！\n嘿嘿……找到了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_01_0040","text":"…………\n哇，找到了♪"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_01_0050","text":"我拿回来了！／拿回来了。\n拿回来了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_01_0060","text":"哦哦，比我想的快多了……\n……咦，每人只找到一个啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_01_0070","text":"这下难办了……我本来打算让赢的人\n可以让我听一个要求的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_01_0080","text":"……原来是这样啊……！\n！那这样的话……甜花，千雪，可以吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_01_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_01_0090","text":"……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_01_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400200_01_0100","text":"嘿嘿，那就请制作人\n听我们每个人各一个要求吧！"}]
